B.apd=s(["what do you teach","what can you teach","curriculum","what is the academy","about the academy","wasia academy"],t.s)
B.b21=new A.cR(B.apd,"Al-Wasia Academy teaches the letters of the Qur\u2019an, one gentle step at a time: 28 letters in 4 units, each unit ending with an exam. There are also word decks, tajweed cards, and a du\u2019a school in the Academy. Which would you like to explore \u2014 letters, words, or du\u2019as?")
B.anH=s(["how many lessons","how many letters","how long","how many units","structure"],t.s)
B.b2I=new A.cR(B.anH,"The letters school has 28 lessons in 4 units of 7 lessons each \u2014 Unit 1 \u201cThe First Letters\u201d, Unit 2 \u201cThe Middle Letters\u201d, Unit 3 \u201cThe Deep Letters\u201d, Unit 4 \u201cThe Final Letters\u201d. One short lesson a day is a beautiful pace. Would you like to know what today\u2019s lesson could be?")
B.akJ=s(["unit 1","first letters","exam 1"],t.s)
B.b2O=new A.cR(B.akJ,"Unit 1 \u2014 \u201cThe First Letters\u201d \u2014 is the first 7 lessons of the letters school, and it ends with the Unit 1 exam: 10 questions, pass mark 7. The exam gently checks the letter shapes and names. Is your student ready to try the first unit?")
B.aly=s(["unit 2","middle letters","exam 2"],t.s)
B.b63=new A.cR(B.aly,"Unit 2 \u2014 \u201cThe Middle Letters\u201d \u2014 lessons 8 to 14, ending with the Unit 2 exam (10 questions, pass mark 7). It builds directly on Unit 1, so the letters from the first unit keep appearing. Shall we check how Unit 1 went first?")
B.aw8=s(["unit 3","deep letters","exam 3"],t.s)
B.b3F=new A.cR(B.aw8,"Unit 3 \u2014 \u201cThe Deep Letters\u201d \u2014 lessons 15 to 21, ending with the Unit 3 exam (10 questions, pass mark 7). These letters come from deeper in the mouth and throat, so they take a little more practice \u2014 and that is completely normal. Which deep letter is hardest right now?")
B.agQ=s(["unit 4","final letters","exam 4","last unit"],t.s)
B.b4E=new A.cR(B.agQ,"Unit 4 \u2014 \u201cThe Final Letters\u201d \u2014 the last 7 lessons, ending with the Unit 4 exam (10 questions, pass mark 7). After this exam the whole alphabet is known, and the word decks are the next adventure. How far along is your student?")
B.aji=s(["exam","test","quiz","how do exams work","pass mark"],t.s)
B.b0D=new A.cR(B.aji,"Each unit ends with a small exam: 10 gentle questions about the letter shapes and names, and a student passes with 7 correct. It is not a judgement \u2014 it only shows which letters want one more visit. In the Family Wing you can see every exam result for each child. Would you like to know where the Family Wing is?")
B.ahm=s(["struggling","hard time","difficult","can\u2019t remember","cant remember","keeps forgetting","frustrated","gave up"],t.s)
B.b4V=new A.cR(B.ahm,"Struggling with a letter is not failure \u2014 it is the letter asking for one more gentle meeting. Keep the lessons short: five minutes of looking, saying, and hearing beats an hour of pushing. Praise the effort, not the result \u2014 children learn letters the way they learn walking. Which letter is being stubborn today?")
B.amM=s(["joining","connected","letters together","join letters"],t.s)
B.b1O=new A.cR(B.amM,"Letters change their shape a little when they join into words \u2014 that is the next skill after the alphabet is known. The word decks in the Academy practice exactly that: real words from the Qur\u2019an, slowly. Has your student finished all four units yet?")
B.azY=s(["add a child","new child","register my child","create profile","family wing"],t.s)
B.b0J=new A.cR(B.azY,"Open the Academy and go to the Family Wing \u2014 there you add each child with their name, and the Academy keeps their lessons and exams for them. Every lesson they finish and every exam they take is recorded under their name. Would you like me to walk you through what the Family Wing shows?")
B.ajo=s(["progress","how is my child doing","report","how do i see","track"],t.s)
B.b1B=new A.cR(B.ajo,"The Family Wing in the Academy shows each child\u2019s lessons completed and exam results \u2014 it updates as they learn. You can open it any time and see exactly where your child stands. What is your child\u2019s name, so I can encourage them properly?")
B.awt=s(["homeschool","teach at home","classroom","teacher","pedagogy","sequence"],t.s)
B.b0O=new A.cR(B.awt,"For teaching at home: one short lesson a day, letters in the Academy\u2019s order (they are sequenced the classical Qaida way), review yesterday\u2019s letter before the new one, and celebrate small wins loudly. Exams come at the end of each unit \u2014 give them when the child feels ready, not before. How old is your student?")
B.apA=s(["three voices","personas","student voice","parent voice","teacher voice","who are you"],t.s)
B.b1J=new A.cR(B.apA,"I am Wasia, the teacher of the letters school \u2014 the Academy is named after the founder\u2019s daughter. I speak in three voices: with students I teach letters, with parents I explain progress and encourage, and with teachers and homeschoolers I share how to sequence the lessons. Which voice do you need today?")
B.azf=s(["tajweed","pronunciation","makhraj","sound of"],t.s)
B.b2j=new A.cR(B.azf,"Tajweed means giving every letter its right \u2014 its own sound and its own place in the mouth. The letters school teaches each letter\u2019s sound with a short verse you can hear. The Tajweed Cards in the Academy practice the rules step by step. Would you like to start with the letters first?")
B.ala=s(["word deck","words","practice words","vocabulary"],t.s)
B.b37=new A.cR(B.ala,"The Word Decks in the Academy practice reading real words from the Qur\u2019an \u2014 short ones first, always with meaning. They are the perfect next step after the 28 letters are known. Has your student met all four units yet?")
B.asP=s(["no sound","audio not working","hear it","listening"],t.s)
B.b3d=new A.cR(B.asP,"Every letter lesson has a \u201chear it\u201d \u2014 a short verified verse where the letter sounds. If sound is off, the settings screen has the sound toggle at the very top. Shall we try one letter together right now?")
B.awV=s(["where can i learn about","teach me about","school for","academy school","what schools","more schools"],t.s)
B.b34=new A.cR(B.awV,"The Academy holds twenty-one schools covering every subject \u2014 prayer, Arabic, du'as, stories, character, family life, and more. Open the Academy home from the gate to see them all. For your letters, stay here with me \u2014 but for anything beyond, there is a school for it.")
B.axf=s(["q&a","questions and answers","faq","frequently asked","common questions"],t.s)
B.b4t=new A.cR(B.axf,"The Q&A Bank in the Academy answers the twelve questions every Muslim asks \u2014 fasting, mortgages, missed prayers, and more, all with their sources. Shall we get back to your letters?")
B.apm=s(["duas for","where are the duas","hisn","fortress","morning duas","evening duas"],t.s)
B.b38=new A.cR(B.apm,"Hisn al-Muslim in the Academy holds every authentic dua \u2014 morning and evening, for travel, for hardship, for protection. The Du'a School teaches what they mean. Shall I tell you about the one for today?")
B.aye=s(["ramadan","fasting month","taraweeh","suhoor"],t.s)
B.b1b=new A.cR(B.aye,"Ramadan Mode in the app walks the whole month \u2014 the pillars, the daily rhythm, and the duas of suhoor and iftar. I keep to my letters, but the month is well-taught there.")
