B.arr=s(["\u0441","\u043b","\u0431","\u043a","\u0442","\u0447","\u043b","\u0441","\u0432","\u0436","\u043b","\u0433"],t.s)
B.b7W=new A.mX("Eat of the Good Things","O people, eat from the earth what is lawful and good, and do not follow the footsteps of Shaytan (2:168). The halal plate is not a restriction list \u2014 it is an invitation to eat well, eat clean, and eat with gratitude.",u.cT)
B.b7R=new A.mX("The Third of the Stomach","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the son of Adam does not fill any vessel worse than his stomach \u2014 a few morsels for his back to stand straight; if he must fill it, then a third for food, a third for drink, a third for breath (Tirmidhi 2380). The oldest diet advice in history, from the one who knew the body\u2019s design.",u.F)
B.b7T=new A.mX("Sleep Is Worship\u2019s Fuel","The Prophet \ufdfa said: when one of you goes to bed, let him brush his hand over his bed \u2014 for he does not know what came upon it after him \u2014 then say: in Your name, my Lord, I lay down my side (Bukhari 6320). Sleep entered the sunna; the night is not a waste, it is the deposit of the morning\u2019s prayer.",u.s)
B.b7V=new A.mX("Moderation in All Things","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the religion is ease (Bukhari 39). And he fasted but did not fast continuously; he prayed but he slept; he worked but he rested. Extremism in worship is not devotion \u2014 it is a debt the body will collect.",u.dR)
B.axZ=s([B.b7W,B.b7R,B.b7T,B.b7V],t.Qt)
B.b8_=new A.GQ("The Body as an Amanah","Your body is a trust \u2014 you did not build it, you were lent it. The Prophet \ufdfa said: your body has a right over you (Bukhari 1839).",B.axZ)
B.b7U=new A.mX("The Prophet\u2019s Own Ruqyah","When any of his family fell ill, the Prophet \ufdfa would recite: in the name of Allah \u2014 I seek refuge in Allah\u2019s might and power from the evil of what I feel and fear (Muslim 2202). Seven times, blowing lightly over the body. The cure begins with refuge, not with the symptom.","Memorize the ruqyah this week \u2014 seven recitations, over your own chest or a loved one\u2019s.")
B.b7Q=new A.mX("The Evil Eye Is Real \u2014 and Curable","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the evil eye is real, and if anything were to overtake the divine decree, it would be the evil eye (Muslim 2188). And he taught the cure: the mu\u2019awwidhat (the last three surahs) recited over the afflicted. The protection is not paranoia; it is a sunna carried lightly.","When you admire something \u2014 your child, your home, your health \u2014 say mashallah, la quwwata illa billah. Guard the blessing by naming its Owner.")
B.b7P=new A.mX("When Medicine and Faith Meet","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah did not send down a disease without sending down its cure (Bukhari 5678). Use the medicine \u2014 the ruqyah does not cancel the doctor; the doctor does not cancel the ruqyah. Seeking treatment is not weak faith; it is the sunna.",u.cL)
B.axk=s([B.b7U,B.b7Q,B.b7P],t.Qt)
B.b7Y=new A.GQ("Ruqyah \u2014 the Qur\u2019an as Medicine","And We send down of the Qur\u2019an that which is healing and mercy for the believers (17:82). The verses are medicine; the reciter is the patient.",B.axk)
B.b7X=new A.mX("The Day of the Heart\u2019s Surgery","The day when neither wealth nor children will avail, except one who comes to Allah with a sound heart (26:88-89). Every practice in this school \u2014 food, sleep, ruqyah, moderation \u2014 is finally aimed here. The sound heart is the only luggage that boards.",u.cG)
B.b7S=new A.mX("Dhikr Is the Heart\u2019s Food","Those who remember Allah standing, sitting, and on their sides (3:191). The heart without dhikr is the body without food \u2014 it does not die loudly; it just grows numb. The morning and evening adhkar are the three meals of the soul.",u.fo)
B.arL=s([B.b7X,B.b7S],t.Qt)
B.b7Z=new A.GQ("The Heart\u2019s Health","The body\u2019s final organ is the heart \u2014 and it has diseases with cures the Qur\u2019an names.",B.arL)
B.ars=s([B.b8_,B.b7Y,B.b7Z],A.ab("z<GQ>"))
