B.xt=new A.el("Quran",u.G,"Quran 13:28")
B.a7k=new A.el("Hadith","Amazing is the affair of the believer \u2014 all of it is good for him: if ease reaches him he is grateful, and if hardship strikes him he is patient.","Sahih Muslim 2999 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a7n=new A.el("Dua","O Allah, I ask You for contentment after decree, and well-being in this world and the Hereafter.","Taught by the Prophet \ufdfa \u2014 Sunan Ibn Majah 3871 \u2014 sahih, excerpt")
B.akV=s([B.xt,B.a7k,B.a7n],t.ov)
B.a7w=new A.j8("peace","At peace","\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f",B.akV)
B.a7f=new A.el("Hadith",u.a5,"Sunan Abi Dawud 4811 \u2014 sahih")
B.a7b=new A.el("Hadith",u.eM,"Sahih al-Bukhari 6412")
B.a79=new A.el("Door","Sujud al-shukr \u2014 the prostration of gratitude. When a blessing reaches you, fall into prostration.","The practice of the Prophet \ufdfa \u2014 Sunan Abi Dawud 2774 \u2014 sahih")
B.asf=s([B.a7f,B.a7b,B.a79],t.ov)
B.a7A=new A.j8("grateful","Grateful","\ud83c\udf37",B.asf)
B.a7e=new A.el("Dua","O Allah, Your mercy I hope for; do not leave me to myself even for the blink of an eye, and set right all my affairs. There is no god but You.","Sunan Abi Dawud 5090 \u2014 sahih")
B.a7g=new A.el("Hadith","If you were to rely upon Allah with true reliance, He would provide for you as He provides for the birds: they leave hungry in the morning and return full.","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2344 \u2014 hasan sahih")
B.aqM=s([B.xt,B.a7e,B.a7g],t.ov)
B.a7v=new A.j8("anxious","Anxious","\ud83c\udf0a",B.aqM)
B.a76=new A.el("Quran",u.dd,"Quran 94:5\u20136")
B.a7o=new A.el("Hadith","No fatigue, illness, anxiety, sorrow or grief touches a Muslim \u2014 not even a thorn \u2014 but that Allah expiates some of his sins by it.","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a7i=new A.el("Dua","La ilaha illa anta, subhanaka, inni kuntu minaz-zalimin \u2014 the dua of Yunus in the three darknesses.","Quran 21:87 \xb7 Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3505")
B.amf=s([B.a76,B.a7o,B.a7i],t.ov)
B.a7x=new A.j8("sad","Sad","\ud83c\udf27\ufe0f",B.amf)
B.a74=new A.el("Hadith",u.ae,"Sahih al-Bukhari 6114")
B.a7s=new A.el("Hadith","When one of you becomes angry, let him say: A\u2019udhu billahi minash-shaytanir-rajim.","Sahih al-Bukhari 6115 \u2014 meaning")
B.a7j=new A.el("Hadith","Anger comes from Shaytan, and Shaytan was created from fire \u2014 and fire is extinguished with water. So when one of you becomes angry, let him make wudu.","Sunan Abi Dawud 4784 \u2014 sahih")
B.azt=s([B.a74,B.a7s,B.a7j],t.ov)
B.a7y=new A.j8("angry","Angry","\ud83d\udd25",B.azt)
B.a73=new A.el("Quran","And He is with you wherever you are.","Quran 57:4 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a7a=new A.el("Hadith",u.f5,u.M)
B.a7t=new A.el("Hadith","The Quran will come as an intercessor for its companions on the Day of Resurrection.","Sahih Muslim 804 \u2014 meaning")
B.as5=s([B.a73,B.a7a,B.a7t],t.ov)
B.a7C=new A.j8("lonely","Lonely","\ud83c\udf19",B.as5)
B.a7h=new A.el("Quran","Allah does not burden a soul beyond what it can bear.","Quran 2:286 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a78=new A.el("Hadith",u.aT,"Sahih al-Bukhari 6464")
B.a7d=new A.el("Door","One row at a time. The deen was revealed over 23 years \u2014 you do not have to carry it all tonight.","The principle of gradualism \u2014 Quran 25:32")
B.au3=s([B.a7h,B.a78,B.a7d],t.ov)
B.a7D=new A.j8("overwhelmed","Overwhelmed","\u26f0\ufe0f",B.au3)
B.a7p=new A.el("Hadith",u.P,"Sahih Muslim 2877")
B.a7l=new A.el("Hadith","Allah is happier with the repentance of His servant than a man who lost his camel in the desert \u2014 with his food and water on it \u2014 and then finds it.","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a7r=new A.el("Quran",u.c0,"Quran 12:87")
B.aol=s([B.a7p,B.a7l,B.a7r],t.ov)
B.a7z=new A.j8("hopeful","Hopeful","\ud83c\udf05",B.aol)
B.a7m=new A.el("Quran","Who, when disaster strikes them, say: Indeed we belong to Allah, and indeed to Him we will return. Those are the ones upon whom are blessings and mercy from their Lord, and those are the guided.","Quran 2:155\u2013157 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a7q=new A.el("Hadith",u.an,"Sahih al-Bukhari 1284 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a77=new A.el("Door",'The Prophet \ufdfa wept at the grave of his son Ibrahim and said: "The eye weeps and the heart grieves, and we say only what pleases our Lord."',"Sahih al-Bukhari 1303 \u2014 excerpt")
B.awS=s([B.a7m,B.a7q,B.a77],t.ov)
B.a7E=new A.j8("grieving","Grieving","\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f",B.awS)
B.a75=new A.el("Quran","Say: O My servants who have transgressed against themselves, do not despair of the mercy of Allah. Indeed, Allah forgives all sins.","Quran 39:53 \u2014 excerpt")
B.a7c=new A.el("Hadith",u.x,"Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 2499 \u2014 hasan")
B.a7u=new A.el("Hadith","A man killed ninety-nine souls, then sought repentance \u2014 and Allah forgave him. No one stands between you and repentance but despair.",u.fk)
B.amD=s([B.a75,B.a7c,B.a7u],t.ov)
B.a7B=new A.j8("sin","Struggling with sin","\ud83c\udf31",B.amD)
B.r1=s([B.a7w,B.a7A,B.a7v,B.a7x,B.a7y,B.a7C,B.a7D,B.a7z,B.a7E,B.a7B],A.ab("z<j8>"))
B.CK=s(["\u0d1c","\u0d2b\u0d46","\u0d2e\u0d3e","\u0d0f","\u0d2e\u0d46","\u0d1c\u0d42\u0d7a","\u0d1c\u0d42","\u0d13","\u0d38\u0d46","\u0d12","\u0d28","\u0d21\u0d3f"],t.s)
B.b6o=new A.m2("Why Marriage at All","Marriage is described in the Qur'an with four words: sukun (tranquility), mawaddah (affection), and rahmah (mercy) (30:21). Notice what is missing: passion, romance, excitement. The house runs on mercy the way the body runs on blood.",u.bH)
B.b6m=new A.m2("The Best of You","The best of you is the one who is best to his wife (Tirmidhi 3895). And the most complete believer in faith is the one with the best character (Tirmidhi 1162). The measure of a Muslim is not the masjid face; it is the kitchen face.",u.p)
B.b6i=new A.m2("Mercy Between You","Allah describes the spouses as 'garments' for one another (2:187) \u2014 the closest thing to the skin, covering faults, providing warmth. The garment does not criticize the body it covers.",u.o)
B.awi=s([B.b6o,B.b6m,B.b6i],t.IV)
B.b6u=new A.Gz("Marriage \u2014 Half the Deen","The Prophet \ufdfa said: when a servant marries, they have completed half of their religion \u2014 so let them fear Allah in the remaining half (Bayhaqi). The home is the smallest masjid.",B.awi)
B.b6q=new A.m2("The First Teacher","The mother of every person carries them in weakness upon weakness (31:14) \u2014 and the Prophet \ufdfa was asked who most deserves good company: your mother, three times, then your father (Bukhari 5971). The home is a madrasa whether you intend it or not.",u.fA)
B.b6p=new A.m2("Teaching the Prayer","Command your children to pray at seven and discipline them about it at ten, and separate their beds (Abu Dawud 495). Before seven the prayer is invited, not enforced \u2014 love first, law second, so the law lands softer.",u.gA)
B.b6l=new A.m2("Mercy, Not Severity","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah is Merciful and loves mercy in all things (Bukhari 6927). And he never struck a servant or a woman, and never struck anything with his hand except in battle (Muslim 2328). The strongest homes are the gentlest.",u.da)
B.b6r=new A.m2("The Best Provision","The best thing a father can give his child is good manners (Tirmidhi 1952). And the most precious inheritance is taqwa \u2014 it is the only wealth that cannot be lost, taxed, or inherited away.",u.cD)
B.ayS=s([B.b6q,B.b6p,B.b6l,B.b6r],t.IV)
B.b6t=new A.Gz("Children \u2014 The Trust","Your children are an amanah \u2014 a trust. The Prophet \ufdfa said: each of you is a shepherd, and each of you is responsible for his flock (Bukhari 893).",B.ayS)
B.b6j=new A.m2("Serving the Family","Aisha was asked what the Prophet \ufdfa did at home. She said: he was in the service of his family (Bukhari 676). He mended his clothes, milked the goat, swept. The man who led the ummah led the dishes.",u.em)
B.b6k=new A.m2("The Family That Prays","The Prophet \ufdfa said: the example of a home where dhikr is made is that of a living tree; and the home where it is not is like a dead tree (Tirmidhi 3377). Dhikr at the door, before meals, at sleep \u2014 small phrases that keep the tree alive.",u.r)
B.b6n=new A.m2("Forgiveness in the House","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah loves the one who is forgiving in buying, forgiving in selling, and forgiving in his claim (Muslim 1726). The house needs this most: forgive the harsh word before the day ends.",u.d4)
B.aqL=s([B.b6j,B.b6k,B.b6n],t.IV)
B.b6s=new A.Gz("The Home as Worship","The house is not a pause between acts of worship \u2014 it is one.",B.aqL)
B.asN=s([B.b6u,B.b6t,B.b6s],A.ab("z<Gz>"))
B.asR=s(["enne Kristust","p\xe4rast Kristust"],t.s)
